### 自动解包 NebulaResponse
GET http://localhost:8090/consumer/users/1

### 透传 NebulaResponse
GET http://localhost:8090/consumer/users/1/raw

### 下游业务异常（BizException，HTTP 200 + Decoder）
GET http://localhost:8090/consumer/users/-1

### 下游 RPC 异常（RpcException，HTTP 500 + ErrorDecoder）
GET http://localhost:8090/consumer/users/1/rpc-error

### POST 创建用户
POST http://localhost:8090/consumer/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "小奏",
  "age": 18
}

### POST 更新用户
POST http://localhost:8090/consumer/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "小奏-updated",
  "age": 19
}

### POST 搜索用户
POST http://localhost:8090/consumer/users/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "小奏",
  "age": 18
}

### POST 慢调用（触发慢调用告警）
POST http://localhost:8090/consumer/users/slow
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "slow-user",
  "age": 20
}
